{{!
    @template format_rumbos/embed

    The Rumbos iframe and the elements the host JavaScript module drives.

    While the map is full screen the exit button owns the top-right 64 x 64 CSS pixels
    of the viewport, above the app (see "Full screen" in the README).

    The sandbox allows only what the app needs:
      - allow-scripts: the app is a JavaScript application.
      - allow-same-origin: without it the document has an opaque origin, so
        every postMessage would arrive with origin "null" and the host could
        not verify who is talking. This is safe only because the app is
        required to be on a different origin than Moodle (see
        format_rumbos\local\config::is_usable()).
      - allow-forms: the app's editor is built on forms (creating and editing
        levels and maps, uploading backgrounds). A sandbox without it blocks
        the submission before the submit event fires, so the app's own handlers
        never run. It gives the app nothing it does not already have with
        scripts: a form can only navigate the iframe itself, because top
        navigation and popups stay blocked.
    Everything else stays blocked: no popups, modals, downloads, top navigation
    or pointer lock. The app does not need popups in this mode, because it
    asks the host to open an activity and the host does it, from its own state.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courseid": 2,
        "suggestediting": true,
        "embedurl": "https://rumbos.example.com/embed?host=https%3A%2F%2Flms.example.com"
    }
}}
<a class="visually-hidden visually-hidden-focusable btn btn-link" href="#format-rumbos-list">
    {{#str}} skipmap, format_rumbos {{/str}}
</a>
{{#suggestediting}}
<p class="text-muted small mb-2" data-region="rumbos-edit-note">{{#str}} turneditingon, format_rumbos {{/str}}</p>
{{/suggestediting}}
<div class="format-rumbos-container mb-3"
     data-region="rumbos-container"
     data-courseid="{{courseid}}"
     role="region"
     aria-label="{{#str}} containerlabel, format_rumbos {{/str}}">
    <div class="alert alert-warning d-none mb-2" role="alert" data-region="rumbos-notice"></div>
    <div class="format-rumbos-frame-wrap" data-region="rumbos-frame-wrap">
        <button type="button"
                class="format-rumbos-exit"
                data-action="rumbos-exit-fullscreen"
                title="{{#str}} exitfullscreen, format_rumbos {{/str}}"
                aria-label="{{#str}} exitfullscreen, format_rumbos {{/str}}"
                hidden>
            <svg class="format-rumbos-exit-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M5 5l14 14M19 5L5 19"/>
            </svg>
        </button>
        <iframe class="format-rumbos-frame"
                data-region="rumbos-frame"
                src="{{embedurl}}"
                title="{{#str}} frametitle, format_rumbos {{/str}}"
                referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
                allow="fullscreen"
                sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms"
                loading="eager"></iframe>
    </div>
</div>
